\v 29 that¦92841 man¦92840 must¦92850 pay her father¦92843 fifty¦92846 silver¦92847 coins, and¦92839 she'll¦92850 become his¦92864 wife because¦92852 he's¦92854 violated¦92854 her¦92854. He'll¦92857 then¦92839 be¦92857 prohibited from \add ever\add* \add ≈divorcing¦92858\add* her¦92858.
