\v 52 They'll surround all¦95666 your¦95668 cities until¦95669 your high¦95672, fortified¦95673 walls¦95671 that¦95674 you¦95675 trusted¦95676 in¦95677 come¦95670 down¦95670 all over your country. \add Yes,\add* you'll be¦95676 \add contained\add* inside your cities throughout the land¦95688 the your¦95688 god¦95692 Yahweh¦95691 has¦95690 given¦95690 you.
