\p
\v 58 If¦95800 you¦95803 don't¦95802 keep following all¦95807 the¦95809 instructions¦95810 that¦95812 are¦95812 written¦95812 in¦95813 this¦95814 book¦95813, i.e., not¦95802 \add ≈honouring and¦95820 showing respect¦95815\add* to¦95815 your¦95824 incredible god¦95824 Yahweh¦95823,
