\c 29
\rem /s1 The Lord's Covenant with Israel in the Land of Moab; Renewal of the Covenant
\p
\v 1 Those¦96058 are the words of¦96062 the agreement that¦96064 Yahweh¦96066 commanded Mosheh¦96051 to¦96067 \add ≈make\add* with the \add ≈Israelis¦96054\add* there in¦96068 Moav, on top of the agreement that he'd \add ≈made\add* with them¦96058 at Horeb \add !(Mt. Sinai)\add*.
\s1 Overview of the agreement
