\v 8 \add ≈After¦96752 that\add*, you'll¦96742 turn¦96742 and¦96743 listen¦96743 to¦96744 Yahweh's¦96745 voice¦96744 and¦96746 follow¦96746 all¦96749 his¦96751 instructions¦96751 that¦96752 I'm¦96753 giving you¦96754 today.
\v 9 Your¦96774 god¦96759 Yahweh¦96758 will¦96757 give you¦96757 prosperity in¦96760 \add ≈everything you work¦96762 on¦96760\add*, and \add ≈in producing children\add*, and \add ≈expanding your herds\add* and \add ≈harvesting your crops\add*. \add *He'll¦96757\add* \add ≈happily¦96778 cause¦96778 you to¦96778 prosper¦96778 just¦96778 like¦96778 he'd¦96778 done¦96778\add* for¦96777 your fathers¦96783,
\v 10 if¦96785 you¦96786 listen¦96786 to¦96787 \add *his\add* voice¦96787, following his¦96791 instructions¦96792 and obeying his rules¦96792 written¦96793 in¦96787 this¦96796 book¦96794, i.e., if¦96797 you¦96798 return¦96798 to¦96799 your god¦96802 Yahweh¦96788 your God¦96789 with \add ≈total¦96803 sincerity\add* and¦96806 with all¦96806 your¦96808 \add ≈energy\add*.
